                <pb facs="0803" n="715" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg715"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr. McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-03-19"><hi rendition="#italic">March 19,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram 19th reporting arrival from Irkutsk of 12 destitute Japanese
                    received. Japanese minister has requested our protection for these refugees.
                    Your action approved by Department.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
